    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "アイドル大運動会、当日……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-4:caption",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「宣誓！　私たちはアイドルとして、何があろうと\n必ず、そして迅速に、ステージに辿り着きます！」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「参加者全員で、1位を目指し、\n正々堂々戦うことを誓います！」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ありがとうございました！\nそれではこれより『アイドル大運動会』の開幕です！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "司会"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "開会式後……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-17:caption",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●●●●●●●監督！\nオレたちの選手宣誓、いい感じだっただろ？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "堂々としていて、かっこよかったですよ！　応援に\n来ている神速一魂の2人も、そう言っていました。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "へへ、もっと褒めてくれていいよ♪\nでも本番では、さらにいいとこ見せるから。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "共演者には、運動能力に自信がある\nマッチョでタフなアイドルが多いみたいだけど……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "元サッカー選手のオレたちに勝てる\nアイドルなんて、いないって！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "フィールドを走り回ってた俺たちの力、\n見せてやろうぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_a:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 25,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だな！　ってことで、●●●●●●●●●●監督。\n優勝はWに任せてよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
